    // Optimized schedule
    // ------------------------------------------------------------------
    //
    // We keep the mathematical structure identical to the original code
    // (same reduction domains and accumulation order per element), but
    // improve locality and parallelism:
    //
    //  * Parallelize across independent rows (i or j).
    //  * Tile and vectorize across the x-fastest dimension (j or l).
    //  * Reorder loops so that:
